    <description>Round robin for every new case (email, voicemail, web, manual) created owned by the Outreach and Enrollment Queue. The team is the queue&apos;s active user members (kept in sync by the Zeta - Outreach &amp; Enrollment user access policy). Strict turns: the new case goes to the member after the owner of the latest case owned by a team member (members sorted by Id, wrapping round; the first member if there is no such case). Manual reassignment of the latest case moves the turn; cases saved in the same instant go to the same person. Cases whose sender is enroll@zetaschools.org (Zoho Desk auto-acknowledgements) are left in the queue. Only OwnerId is written; on any error the case stays in the queue. The new owner then gets a "Case Assigned" in-app/mobile notification; a notification failure is ignored so the assignment stands.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>fmNotificationBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>"Case " &amp; {!$Record.CaseNumber} &amp; ": " &amp; {!$Record.Subject}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fmSlot</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>MOD({!varLastIndex} + 1, {!varUserCount})</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Case Round Robin Outreach Enrollment {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Case Round Robin Outreach Enrollment</label>
